WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.720
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.060
&gt;&gt; Hi.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.000
My name is Savas Parastatidis.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.040
I'm Cortana's architect and

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.500
co-founder.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.920
We are here to present Cortana,

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.960
who is your personal assistant.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.200
She's been used by about 150

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.700
million users today across the

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.680
PC, Android, iOS, Xbox and very

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.800
soon by a device like this one

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.500
what we call the intelligent

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.040
speaker at home.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.640
Cortana follows you wherever you

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.040
are, and she tries to understand

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.360
you so she can provide you with

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.460
the best personalized experience

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.120
you can get from a personal

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.160
assistant.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.160
Cortana reads your e-mails so

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.300
she can understand the

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.460
commitments that you're making

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:56.860
to others and remind you when

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.640
that commitment is due.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.780
She tracks your appointments so

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:01.780
she knows where you need to be

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:05.620
at what time, and she informs

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.280
you if there is traffic along

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:10.640
the way to ensure that you are

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.780
where you need to be at the

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:12.980
right time.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:16.020
She allows you to track your

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.180
grocery list.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:20.140
She lets you play music.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:23.120
She will allow you to stream a

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:26.180
news-related podcast.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.780
In general, Cortana is your

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:29.720
personal assistant helping you

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.600
to be productive and go on with

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.840
your life, helping you save

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.940
time.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:38.140
You should try and use it on

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.420
your PC and on the phone, your

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.920
iPhone or Android device.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.820
Thank you.

